<title>INDIA: India cabinet approves autonomous tariff panel.</title>
<headline>India cabinet approves autonomous tariff panel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian cabinet on Friday approved the setting up of an autonomous commission to recommend tariff levels, the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be an autonomous, transparent advisory mechanism that will recommend tariff levels for traded products taking into consideration...the prevailing international competitive market structure for a product, long-term viability of the industry and strategic considerations,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
